### ============================================================
### 13. SHOWTIME
### Depends on Movie + Room + existing active Seats.
### Run this AFTER Seat mutation tests because scheduled showtimes lock seat changes.
### ============================================================

### 13.1 Create Showtime
POST {{baseUrl}}/showtimes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": "{{movieId}}",
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "showDate": "2030-01-15",
  "startTime": "2030-01-15T19:00:00",
  "endTime": "2030-01-15T21:30:00",
  "language": "English",
  "subtitleLanguage": "Vietnamese",
  "format": "IMAX",
  "basePrice": 120000,
  "status": "SCHEDULED"
}

> {%
client.test("Create Showtime -> 201", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 201, "Expected HTTP 201");
});
client.global.set("showtimeId", response.body.data.id);
%}


### 13.2 Get Showtime by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtimeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 13.3 Showtime by Cinema + date
### This is the API shape useful for "Lịch chiếu theo rạp".
GET {{baseUrl}}/showtimes?cinemaId={{cinemaId}}&showDate=2030-01-15&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 13.4 Showtime by Movie + Format + available seats
GET {{baseUrl}}/showtimes?movieId={{movieId}}&format=IMAX&available=true&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 13.5 Showtime by date/time/price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/showtimes?showDateFrom=2030-01-01&showDateTo=2030-01-31&startTimeFrom=2030-01-15T00:00:00&startTimeTo=2030-01-15T23:59:59&minPrice=100000&maxPrice=200000&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 13.6 Update Showtime
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtimeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "basePrice": 130000,
  "subtitleLanguage": "Vietnamese"
}


### 13.7 Cancel Showtime
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtimeId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

